1
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:49,420
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,360
=Episode 12=

3
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:53,079
Oh.

4
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:01,640
To go deeper into the Wilds of Lize,

5
00:01:01,679 --> 00:01:03,920
we must pass through Greed, Wrath,
Obsession, and Hate.

6
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:07,120
Then Doubt, Envy, Pride, Fear, and more.

7
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:10,359
Most Hunters only make it
past the first few.

8
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:13,319
One Yuanzhen disciple made it
to the Envy Gate.

9
00:01:14,239 --> 00:01:15,040
(Ah!)

10
00:01:15,599 --> 00:01:17,000
If only there were a shortcut

11
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,680
straight to the deepest part.

12
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:20,239
(Dream on.)

13
00:01:20,239 --> 00:01:21,200
If such a path existed,

14
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:23,719
why would Xuanwu Sect
go through all that trouble

15
00:01:23,719 --> 00:01:25,079
to host the Grand Demon Hunt?

16
00:01:25,319 --> 00:01:26,599
Rumor does say there is one gate

17
00:01:26,599 --> 00:01:27,840
that leads straight
to the deepest depths.

18
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,400
But its difficulty

19
00:01:29,719 --> 00:01:31,079
surpasses all nine gates combined.

20
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,239
Though no one has ever found it.

21
00:01:35,079 --> 00:01:36,760
(Why do I feel like)

22
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:38,200
(I have been here before?)

23
00:01:41,519 --> 00:01:42,319
Awooo!

24
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:45,519
(What did this demon come from?)

25
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:48,159
(He's a Taoist from the human realm.)

26
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,680
(His spiritual energy is so rich!)

27
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:53,799
(Perfect for restoring my Essence.)

28
00:01:54,879 --> 00:01:57,599
Ah!

29
00:01:57,599 --> 00:01:58,560
(I can't hold back.)

30
00:02:06,239 --> 00:02:07,400
(So this is where it is.)

31
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:11,280
(Why does this feel so familiar?)

32
00:02:16,599 --> 00:02:19,719
(What a delicious young Taoist, hehehe.)

33
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:22,199
(What a strange little demon.)

34
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:26,360
(Hehe...
she's not that scary after all.)

35
00:02:27,159 --> 00:02:29,039
Hehehe.

36
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:32,599
Hehehe.

37
00:02:34,759 --> 00:02:39,280
Hehehe.

38
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:42,400
(So in this lifetime,)

39
00:02:43,439 --> 00:02:45,240
(we still met long ago.)

40
00:02:48,337 --> 00:02:50,630
(Once you step in,
there is no turning back.)

41
00:02:52,199 --> 00:02:53,439
Once you step in,
there is no turning back.

42
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,120
You only get one chance.

43
00:02:56,439 --> 00:02:57,520
If this fails...

44
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,759
Ziyan, if this fails,

45
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,439
I will surely...

46
00:03:03,439 --> 00:03:04,759
With me here, we won't fail.

47
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:15,240
(The Stone is hidden in the deepest part
of the Wilds of Lize.)

48
00:03:15,479 --> 00:03:16,800
(And within the Wilds of Lize,)

49
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,919
(there're
Sixty‑four Heavenly Stem labyrinths.)

50
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,400
(Dangers lurk within.)

51
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,439
(If you can get the Five Spirits Pendant
from Xuanwu Sect,)

52
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:24,400
(it can take you directly)

53
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,879
(to the deepest part.)

54
00:03:28,479 --> 00:03:29,879
I need to borrow your pendant.

55
00:03:31,919 --> 00:03:32,800
What good is this betrothal...

56
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,120
I mean, family heirloom?

57
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,599
Ah?

58
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,159
Ah!

59
00:03:41,353 --> 00:03:42,826
(Once you step in,
there is no turning back.)

60
00:03:54,159 --> 00:03:56,400
(Into the Pale Realm.)

61
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,599
(Where one)

62
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:01,360
(must choose.)

63
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,000
(This place...)

64
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,759
(why does it look exactly like
the young Taoist's dreams?)

65
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:10,319
(The Four Symbols
govern fortune and misfortune.)

66
00:04:11,199 --> 00:04:12,560
(What's past is done.)

67
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:16,439
(The four of them
are trapped in the mirrors.)

68
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,560
(This will reveal their true hearts.)

69
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,680
(Stripped of pretense,)

70
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:21,959
(of masks,)

71
00:04:22,879 --> 00:04:24,920
(their honest feelings toward you.)

72
00:04:33,839 --> 00:04:35,079
"Junior"? Please.

73
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,399
Just being polite.

74
00:04:36,759 --> 00:04:38,240
I only have one Junior.

75
00:04:38,839 --> 00:04:40,720
One more mouth means more food wasted.

76
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,680
You eat like you've never seen food.

77
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,040
Look at the amount you put away.

78
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,399
You're nothing but a burden.

79
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,399
And you have no shame.

80
00:04:47,279 --> 00:04:48,879
Say that again and I will hit you.

81
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,959
Hmph.

82
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:55,120
What "goddess"?

83
00:04:56,399 --> 00:04:57,199
Hmph.

84
00:04:57,319 --> 00:04:58,519
You do not deserve that title.

85
00:05:00,079 --> 00:05:03,079
You're just a pretty little plaything
for the moment.

86
00:05:04,439 --> 00:05:07,759
I'll have my way with you
sooner or later.

87
00:05:10,319 --> 00:05:11,720
You dirty pervert!

88
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:13,240
I'll slap you silly!

89
00:05:16,519 --> 00:05:17,360
Demoness.

90
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,399
Go on.

91
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:21,120
Keep pretending.

92
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:24,759
I saw through your disguise
from the start.

93
00:05:26,199 --> 00:05:27,800
The moment you slip up,

94
00:05:28,639 --> 00:05:31,199
I'll tear you apart.

95
00:05:31,199 --> 00:05:32,160
I'll destroy your very soul.

96
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:34,720
So what? Hmph.

97
00:05:37,279 --> 00:05:38,199
(Now it is your turn.)

98
00:05:38,439 --> 00:05:39,560
(Young Taoist.)

99
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,680
You are a demoness

100
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:44,480
sent to seduce and corrupt me.

101
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,639
Anything inhuman

102
00:05:46,879 --> 00:05:48,160
is an abomination.

103
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,360
As a Taoist,

104
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:51,800
it is my duty to slay you

105
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,360
before you harm more people.

106
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,800
Slay me? Fine.

107
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:58,399
Let's see who eats who first.

108
00:05:58,600 --> 00:05:59,800
Pesky Taoist.

109
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:00,959
Tch!

110
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:04,519
(To break this illusion and survive,)

111
00:06:05,519 --> 00:06:09,199
(you must choose one of the four mirrors
and kill the person inside.)

112
00:06:09,959 --> 00:06:12,680
(Only if he dies can you live.)

113
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:14,839
(Only if he dies)

114
00:06:15,839 --> 00:06:16,920
(can you live.)

115
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,199
(Only if he dies)

116
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,680
(can you live.)

117
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:25,160
(Only if he dies)

118
00:06:26,399 --> 00:06:27,560
(can you live.)

119
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:30,800
(Only if he dies)

120
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,079
(can you live.)

121
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:48,399
You don't actually think
I'm that stupid, do you?

122
00:06:48,839 --> 00:06:50,439
That's old news in the Demon Realm.

123
00:06:50,439 --> 00:06:51,439
And you're still using it?

124
00:06:51,839 --> 00:06:54,160
Everything here is an illusion.

125
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:56,600
Even I am just a mirror image.

126
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,519
If I can break myself,

127
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:00,439
the game is over, right?

128
00:07:02,279 --> 00:07:03,800
Hey, you.

129
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,839
You should get out more
and see the world.

130
00:07:06,319 --> 00:07:07,759
Next time, come up with something

131
00:07:07,759 --> 00:07:09,199
more creative and fun.

132
00:07:09,879 --> 00:07:11,120
I don't have time for this.

133
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,399
Phew.

134
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:27,199
Finally made it out.

135
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:30,519
They would

136
00:07:30,519 --> 00:07:32,680
make the same choice I did, right?

137
00:07:58,879 --> 00:08:01,079
(No. Why can't I use my spells?)

138
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:03,000
(I need to go back and get them out.)

139
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:07,600
(Stab yourselves with your swords.)

140
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,000
(Die to live.)

141
00:08:09,079 --> 00:08:10,199
(That breaks the illusion.)

142
00:08:12,519 --> 00:08:13,360
(Yuanchu.)

143
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,560
(What happened to you?)

144
00:08:15,319 --> 00:08:16,120
(Yuanchu,)

145
00:08:16,759 --> 00:08:18,199
(can you hear me?)

146
00:08:19,439 --> 00:08:20,800
(Yuanchu, what is wrong?)

147
00:08:21,959 --> 00:08:23,560
(To break
the Thousand-Fold Love Ordeal,)

148
00:08:23,839 --> 00:08:25,759
(you must kill the one you love.)

149
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:28,399
(This is Yuanchu's illusion.)

150
00:08:30,439 --> 00:08:31,839
(At a time like this,)

151
00:08:32,159 --> 00:08:33,559
(he is still thinking about that woman.)

152
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,440
This pesky Taoist,

153
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:37,639
what a player.

154
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:55,720
How is this possible?

155
00:08:56,799 --> 00:08:57,960
I never expected...

156
00:08:59,639 --> 00:09:01,519
the person
in his Thousand-Fold Love Ordeal

157
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,480
has always been me.

158
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:20,279
Yuanchu, wake up!

159
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:21,360
Yuanchu!

160
00:09:22,279 --> 00:09:23,080
Wake up!

161
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:24,440
Yuanchu, wake up!

162
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:40,159
You are amazing, Ziyan.

163
00:09:40,759 --> 00:09:42,120
Figuring out how to break the illusion.

164
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,960
Thankfully, goddess,

165
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:46,399
we all survived.

166
00:09:48,519 --> 00:09:49,320
Ziyan,

167
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:50,840
are you okay?

168
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,120
I'm fine.

169
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:55,960
But I feel completely drained.

170
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:57,720
And I tried using my spells,

171
00:09:57,919 --> 00:09:59,320
but nothing works.

172
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:00,919
Could it be

173
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,919
the illusion drained my power?

174
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,840
Whoever set this trap

175
00:10:06,159 --> 00:10:08,120
wanted us to trade our power
for our lives.

176
00:10:08,759 --> 00:10:11,559
Our spiritual energy
is probably feeding him now.

177
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:14,519
We trained so hard for this power...

178
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,639
What do we do now?

179
00:10:29,039 --> 00:10:29,840
Hmm.

180
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:33,240
I checked each of your meridians.

181
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,159
Your Spirit Roots are intact.

182
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:37,000
It's only temporary.

183
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:41,200
Hmm.

184
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,000
Given this situation,

185
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,879
we need to find a safe place

186
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:46,399
and figure out our next move.

187
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:48,000
Hmm.

188
00:10:48,519 --> 00:10:49,120
Ziyan,

189
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:51,799
I heard the Divine Stone
can elevate anyone to godhood overnight.

190
00:10:51,799 --> 00:10:52,679
Once I find it,

191
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:53,759
I will give it to you.

192
00:10:57,399 --> 00:10:58,759
(You will either kill me)

193
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,360
(or use me to mend the sky.)

194
00:11:01,039 --> 00:11:02,320
(Either way, I am dead.)

195
00:11:02,799 --> 00:11:04,080
(What am I hesitating for?)

196
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:05,759
(What am I holding on to?)

197
00:11:10,559 --> 00:11:11,399
Here you come.

198
00:11:15,919 --> 00:11:17,519
(Such overwhelming demonic power...)

199
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:20,919
(so strong it makes me want to flee.)

200
00:11:42,417 --> 00:11:46,345
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

201
00:11:46,617 --> 00:11:49,790
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

202
00:11:49,831 --> 00:11:53,345
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

203
00:11:53,531 --> 00:11:56,465
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

204
00:11:56,745 --> 00:12:03,515
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

205
00:12:04,161 --> 00:12:10,849
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

206
00:12:11,755 --> 00:12:15,425
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

207
00:12:15,535 --> 00:12:19,225
♪I shatter the hollow fate
they wrote for me♪

208
00:12:19,397 --> 00:12:25,631
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
